      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹0.029 (down from ₹0.084 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹1.05m (down 22% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹295.0k (down 65% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 28% (down from 63% in 3Q 2025). The decrease in margin was primarily driven by higher expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 13% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 7% per year, which means it is well ahead of earnings.",
